        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="54" height="45" viewBox="0 0 54 45" fill="none">
            <circle cx="27" cy="22.5" r="20" stroke="var(--main-accent-light)" stroke-width="4"/>
            <path d="M20 22.5L24 26.5L34 16.5" stroke="var(--main-accent-light)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-content">
          <h3>Confidential Meetings and Consultation Process.</h3>
          <div class="separator"></div>
          <p>Boggarts red daisies sirius grayback floor fanged kedavra lily. Smile grim floo pie wand floo moon juice us levicorpus.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="54" height="40" viewBox="0 0 54 40" fill="none">
            <rect x="5" y="15" width="44" height="25" rx="4" stroke="var(--main-accent-light)" stroke-width="3"/>
            <path d="M15 25L20 30L35 15" stroke="var(--main-accent-light)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <circle cx="27" cy="10" r="8" stroke="var(--main-accent-light)" stroke-width="3"/>
          </svg>
